---
import ProjectBrief from './ProjectBrief.astro';
import JourneyStudio from './JourneyStudio.astro';
---
<section class="atelier-hero" aria-labelledby="cinema-heading" data-world="websites">
  <div class="atelier-grain" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="container atelier-hero-inner">
    <div class="atelier-hero-top"><p class="atelier-kicker">INDEPENDENT DIGITAL STUDIO</p><span class="atelier-edition">DESIGN WITH INTENTION / BUILT TO LAST</span></div>
    <div class="atelier-hero-grid">
      <div class="atelier-copy">
        <p class="atelier-index"><span></span> DISTINCTIVE BY DESIGN</p>
        <h1 id="cinema-heading">A website that <em>feels ahead.</em></h1>
        <p class="atelier-lead">For businesses ready to look as good<br class="desktop-break"/> as the work they do.</p>
        <div class="atelier-actions"><a class="atelier-button" href="#project-brief">Make your next move <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="atelier-text-link" href="#cinema-work">Explore the work <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div>
        <p class="atelier-quiet">Thoughtful websites. Clear scope. Yours to own.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="atelier-art" data-tilt>
        <div class="atelier-orbit" aria-hidden="true"><span class="orbit-node"></span></div>
        <svg class="atelier-sculpture" viewBox="0 0 700 700" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
          <defs>
            <linearGradient id="metal" x1="95" y1="70" x2="615" y2="640" gradientUnits="userSpaceOnUse"><stop stop-color="#6c5540"/><stop offset=".19" stop-color="#e8d6ac"/><stop offset=".32" stop-color="#fff5dc"/><stop offset=".45" stop-color="#9f7e54"/><stop offset=".61" stop-color="#2b2420"/><stop offset=".77" stop-color="#bda27b"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#f1e0bf"/></linearGradient>
            <linearGradient id="rim" x1="165" y1="130" x2="550" y2="560" gradientUnits="userSpaceOnUse"><stop stop-color="#f8e8c5"/><stop offset=".48" stop-color="#8e6f49"/><stop offset=".8" stop-color="#191a18"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#d5b68b"/></linearGradient>
            <radialGradient id="well"><stop stop-color="#0b1011"/><stop offset=".65" stop-color="#101719"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#594a38"/></radialGradient>
            <filter id="soft-shadow" x="-50%" y="-50%" width="200%" height="200%"><feGaussianBlur stdDeviation="20"/></filter>
          </defs>
          <ellipse cx="360" cy="580" rx="210" ry="36" fill="#000" opacity=".5" filter="url(#soft-shadow)"/>
          <g transform="rotate(-30 350 350)">
            <ellipse cx="365" cy="367" rx="208" ry="269" fill="#342c23"/>
            <ellipse cx="350" cy="350" rx="210" ry="270" fill="url(#metal)"/>
            <ellipse cx="350" cy="350" rx="151" ry="211" fill="url(#well)" stroke="url(#rim)" stroke-width="3"/>
            <ellipse cx="350" cy="350" rx="204" ry="264" stroke="#f8e7c5" stroke-opacity=".45"/>
            <ellipse cx="350" cy="350" rx="160" ry="220" stroke="#e4cfa7" stroke-opacity=".25"/>
            <path d="M230 142C293 91 386 86 455 145" stroke="#fff4dc" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" opacity=".6"/>
          </g>
          <path d="M111 445C-18 284 266 114 517 181C764 246 592 551 290 561" stroke="url(#rim)" stroke-width="1"/>
          <circle cx="578" cy="285" r="7" fill="#ead5ae"/><circle cx="150" cy="483" r="4" fill="#ead5ae"/>
        </svg>
        <div class="atelier-art-label" aria-hidden="true"><span>FORM</span><span>MEETS FUNCTION</span></div>
        <div class="atelier-preview atelier-preview-web" data-world-panel="websites">
          <div class="preview-browser"><span><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span>DESIGN DIRECTION / 01</span><span>↗</span></div>
          <div class="preview-web-inner"><p>STONE &amp; STREAM</p><div class="preview-arch" aria-hidden="true"></div><h2>Room<br/>to <em>grow.</em></h2><span class="preview-caption">A LANDSCAPING WEBSITE CONCEPT</span></div>
          <div class="preview-foot"><span>Illustrative concept</span><span>BUILT AROUND YOUR BUSINESS</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="atelier-preview atelier-preview-audit" data-world-panel="audits" hidden>
          <div class="preview-browser"><span><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span>REVIEW DIRECTION / 02</span><span>↗</span></div>
          <div class="preview-audit-inner"><span class="atelier-badge">COMING SOON</span><h2>Look beyond<br/><em>the interface.</em></h2><div class="audit-outline"><span>01 / Scope &amp; permissions</span><span>02 / Source-code review</span><span>03 / Evidence &amp; next steps</span></div></div>
          <div class="preview-foot"><span>Illustrative report structure</span><span>NOT A COMPLETED AUDIT</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="atelier-hero-bottom"><div class="atelier-worlds" role="group" aria-label="Explore our two directions"><button type="button" data-world-select="websites" aria-pressed="true"><span>01</span> Website design <i aria-hidden="true">↗</i></button><button type="button" data-world-select="audits" aria-pressed="false"><span>02</span> AI-app reviews <small>COMING SOON</small></button></div><span class="atelier-scroll">SCROLL TO DISCOVER <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></span></div>
    <p class="sr-only" data-world-status aria-live="polite">Website design concept selected.</p>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="atelier-manifesto container" data-reveal><p class="atelier-kicker">GOOD DESIGN IS NOT DECORATION.</p><h2>It’s the difference between<br/><span>being seen</span> and <em>being remembered.</em></h2><p>We turn what makes your business distinctive into a digital experience with presence. Beautiful to explore. Simple to use. Built around a clear next step.</p></section>
<JourneyStudio/>
<section class="atelier-work" id="cinema-work" aria-labelledby="cinema-work-heading"><div class="container">
  <div class="atelier-section-head" data-reveal><div><p class="atelier-kicker">01 / SELECTED DIRECTIONS</p><h2 id="cinema-work-heading">Different businesses.<br/><em>Distinctive worlds.</em></h2></div><p>Three interactive concepts. Three very different personalities. A glimpse of what a considered website can feel like.</p></div>
  <div class="atelier-work-grid">
    <a class="atelier-work-card concept-wash" href="/showcase/exterior/" data-reveal><div class="concept-art"><div class="concept-top"><span>RINSE &amp; RISE</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div><div class="wash-rings" aria-hidden="true"></div><strong>Pure<br/><em>impact.</em></strong><span class="concept-art-caption">A FRESH PERSPECTIVE ON EXTERIOR CARE</span></div><div class="concept-meta"><div><h3>Rinse &amp; Rise</h3><p>Exterior cleaning / Confident &amp; kinetic</p></div><span class="concept-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div><span class="concept-disclosure">FICTIONAL INTERACTIVE CONCEPT</span></a>
    <a class="atelier-work-card concept-pool" href="/showcase/pool/" data-reveal><div class="concept-art"><div class="concept-top"><span>BLUE HOUR</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div><div class="pool-steps" aria-hidden="true"></div><strong>Beyond<br/><em>the blue.</em></strong><span class="concept-art-caption">A CALMER KIND OF POOL CARE</span></div><div class="concept-meta"><div><h3>Blue Hour</h3><p>Pool care / Calm &amp; considered</p></div><span class="concept-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div><span class="concept-disclosure">FICTIONAL INTERACTIVE CONCEPT</span></a>
    <a class="atelier-work-card concept-land" href="/showcase/landscape/" data-reveal><div class="concept-art"><div class="concept-top"><span>STONE &amp; STREAM</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div><div class="land-arch" aria-hidden="true"></div><strong>Ground<br/><em>work.</em></strong><span class="concept-art-caption">SPACES WITH ROOM TO BREATHE</span></div><div class="concept-meta"><div><h3>Stone &amp; Stream</h3><p>Landscaping / Natural &amp; editorial</p></div><span class="concept-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div><span class="concept-disclosure">FICTIONAL INTERACTIVE CONCEPT</span></a>
  </div><p class="atelier-work-note">Original agency-made concepts, not commissioned client projects. No borrowed testimonials or invented results.</p>
</div></section>
<section class="atelier-two-worlds container" aria-labelledby="two-worlds-heading"><div class="atelier-section-head" data-reveal><div><p class="atelier-kicker">02 / FORM. FUNCTION. A LITTLE FURTHER.</p><h2 id="two-worlds-heading">Beautiful outside.<br/><em>Considered within.</em></h2></div><p>Website design is where we begin. Source-code security reviews are the next direction we’re preparing.</p></div><div class="atelier-service-grid">
  <article class="atelier-service" data-reveal><span class="atelier-service-number">01</span><p class="atelier-kicker">AVAILABLE NOW</p><h3>A better<br/><em>digital presence.</em></h3><p>A defined five-page website. Responsive design, a working enquiry route and source files you own.</p><div class="atelier-service-tail"><span>US$500 <small>DEFINED WEBSITE BUILD</small></span><button class="atelier-detail-button" data-dialog-open="website-details" aria-haspopup="dialog" hidden>View scope <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button><a class="atelier-text-link" href="/services/">Full website scope ↗</a></div></article>
  <article class="atelier-service atelier-service-future" data-reveal><span class="atelier-service-number">02</span><p class="atelier-kicker"><span class="atelier-badge">COMING SOON</span></p><h3>A closer look<br/><em>under the surface.</em></h3><p>Planned AI-app security reviews, grounded in authorized source-code access, evidence and practical next steps.</p><div class="atelier-service-tail"><span>In preparation <small>NO AUDIT BOOKINGS YET</small></span><a class="atelier-text-link" href="/audits/">Explore the direction ↗</a></div></article>
</div></section>
<section class="atelier-brief-section" aria-labelledby="atelier-brief-heading"><div class="container atelier-brief-grid"><div data-reveal><p class="atelier-kicker">03 / YOUR NEXT CHAPTER</p><h2 id="atelier-brief-heading">Let’s make<br/><em>something matter.</em></h2><p class="atelier-brief-lead">A next step that feels simple.</p><p>Tell us where you want to go. We’ll start with an email conversation, a clear scope and an intentional direction.</p><div class="atelier-process"><span><b>01</b> Define</span><span><b>02</b> Build</span><span><b>03</b> Refine</span><span><b>04</b> Own</span></div><p class="atelier-terms"><strong>US$500</strong> for a defined five-page website.<br/>$250 to start after written approval. $250 after accepted staging. Two consolidated revision rounds.</p><a class="atelier-text-link" href="/approach/">A clear process, from day one ↗</a></div><ProjectBrief/></div></section>
<dialog class="atelier-dialog" id="website-details" aria-labelledby="website-details-title"><div class="atelier-dialog-inner"><form method="dialog"><button class="atelier-dialog-close" aria-label="Close website scope">×</button></form><p class="atelier-kicker">THE SIGNATURE WEBSITE</p><h2 id="website-details-title">A clear scope.<br/><em>A considered result.</em></h2><p>US$500 for up to five marketing pages, a scoped enquiry form, basic on-page SEO, two consolidated revision rounds and portable source handover.</p><p>US$250 after written scope approval. US$250 after explicit staging acceptance. Final balance clears before handover or deployment.</p><p>Domain, hosting and third-party services are agreed separately. Custom apps, ecommerce, ongoing SEO and AI-app audits are not included.</p><a class="atelier-button" href="/services/">Read the complete terms <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></dialog>
